  "question": {
    "text": "Four successive members of the first row of transition elements are listed below with atomic numbers. Which one of them is expected to have the highest&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mtext>E</mtext><mrow><msup><mtext>M</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mtext>M</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math>&nbsp;value?"
  },
  "options": [
